’ll have to either <strong>press random buttons</strong> or <strong>solve puzzles (boo!)</strong> just to reach the bombs… or actually defuse them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S. Option 1 is handy to quickly get rid of a useless teammate… just sayin.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/f6a94f965626d726f8c1c702fa98667c.poster.avif?t=1781569890\" width=608 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/f6a94f965626d726f8c1c702fa98667c.webm?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/f6a94f965626d726f8c1c702fa98667c.mp4?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oh, and that's not even the worst part</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah… there are <strong>enemies</strong>. And somehow, they always show up at the <strong>worst possible time</strong>. Mid-puzzle? Of course. Carrying something important? Naturally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So be ready to run—and you better hope you’re good at it. Use whatever you can to stop them from ruining the mission, even your teammates...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/730b9ba455b19259b36e57ab5c3065ea.poster.avif?t=1781569890\" width=608 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/730b9ba455b19259b36e57ab5c3065ea.webm?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/730b9ba455b19259b36e57ab5c3065ea.mp4?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eeh, what else, resources, right</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you can do anything meaningful, you’ll need to <strong>hunt for resources</strong> scattered around the facility. Batteries, keycards, and other mission-critical junk are waiting… you need them to <strong>survive the mission</strong>, not to feel special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, occasionally, you might stumble across a <strong>bonus item</strong>—the kind that sparks instant betrayal, screaming, or a full-blown debate over who <i>“found it first.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/1178a53ffa2594923c6da767f9fd3e11.poster.avif?t=1781569890\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/1178a53ffa2594923c6da767f9fd3e11.webm?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/1178a53ffa2594923c6da767f9fd3e11.mp4?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oh, and literally everything is working against you… even your teammates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power outages, fires, traps, and who knows what else are waiting around every corner. One wrong step—or an <strong>“oops, I pressed the wrong button”</strong> moment from a friend—can instantly slow or sabotage the mission. <strong>Be careful… if that’s even possible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/1acfcbaeefca53c070d92a7b5ce3f052.poster.avif?t=1781569890\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/1acfcbaeefca53c070d92a7b5ce3f052.webm?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/1acfcbaeefca53c070d92a7b5ce3f052.mp4?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pro tip: Social distancing is key</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a safe distance from your teammates—one step too close, and it’s a <strong>human fireworks show.</strong> Some bombs are sound-sensitive, so maybe give anyone who can’t stop screaming <strong>50 meters</strong>… <i>for your own safety.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/165e16ba35d372e104f5d0d741e7552d.poster.avif?t=1781569890\" width=608 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/165e16ba35d372e104f5d0d741e7552d.webm?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/165e16ba35d372e104f5d0d741e7552d.mp4?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear up &amp; repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to the shop, grab <strong>some new gear</strong>, and dive straight into the next mission. The facilities change, the bombs get trickier, and the <strong>chaos never ends—so be ready.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and don’t forget to <strong>kick that friend</strong> who <i>“accidentally”</i> cut the red wire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/56aa955d0964280a769943e7101d8522.poster.avif?t=1781569890\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/56aa955d0964280a769943e7101d8522.webm?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/extras/56aa955d0964280a769943e7101d8522.mp4?t=1781569890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 5 friends—or go solo if you’re brave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat (and scream) through <strong>proximity voice chat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle <strong>tons of different bomb types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> make each run dynamic and chaotic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate facilities packed with <strong>traps, power outages, and environmental hazards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge <strong>mission-critical resources</strong> to solve puzzles and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>bonus loot</strong> that sparks instant chaos between teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully <strong>online co-op</strong> or offline single-player mode</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Oops Unit is an online co-op game where up to 6 players team up as a bomb squad. Solve puzzles, gather resources, and push through deadly traps and enemies to reach and defuse every bomb. Extract, buy new gear, and repeat—or die trying, because anything, even your friends, can sabotage the mission.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/d60462fd5ce2cb0cd7758e0baabeeb71fb80785d/header.jpg?t=1781569890", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/ca52c9aabe9ae0f52df880d0c2c19167edc41dbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781569890", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075860/ca52c9aabe9ae0f52df880d0c2c19167edc41dbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781569890", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 520 / NVIDIA GeForce GT 730 / AMD Radeon R7 240 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Suronix"], "publishers": ["Suronix"], "demos": [{"appid": 4574260, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 70, "description": "Surround Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steams